{
    "title": "IPTV Player: Watch Live TV",
    "description": "IPTV player is a convenient media player which enables users to easily watch videos, live TV streams, movies and series with its built-in powerful smarter player by adding online or local M3U & M3U8 files or Xtream Code Api. You can install this smart IPTV stream player on the phone, tablet and Android TV to enjoy your ultimate IPTV xtream player experience!\r\n\r\nIMPORTANT: This IPTV player app doesn't supply or include any media content. We have no affiliation with any content providers and can't be responsible for the content provided by third parties.\r\n\r\nMain Features:\r\n- Support adding unlimited M3U/M3U8 streaming playlists. \r\n- Support adding Xtream Code Api.\r\n- Support analyzing M3U/M3U8 formats with EPG information.\r\n- Easily add M3U/M3U8 files from online websites & the local folders of your device.\r\n- Watch IPTV live streams with built-in powerful IPTV Player.\r\n- Cast to smart TVs enabled with Chromcast and get rid of small screens' limitations.\r\n- Adjust playback ratio, volume and brightness per your habits and preferences.\r\n- Screen locks to avoid its rotation when moving the phone.\r\n- Fast search for channel and add it to Favorites with one tap.\r\n- Quickly find the watched program from Recently Viewed.\r\n- Automatically update your tivimate IPTV playlist.\r\n- Watch live TV on the phone, tablet and Android TV.\r\n\r\nHow to add M3U/M3U8 files? \r\n-Click the \"Add\" button on the smarter player playlist page.\r\n-Select \"Add M3U link\" and enter your M3U link in the input box.\r\n-Wait for the loading to complete to watch live TV for free.\r\n\r\nAdvantages:\r\n\u25b6\ufe0fThe stream player app is compatible perfectly with phones, tablets and Android TV.\r\n\u25b6\ufe0fOur IPTV player works well with M3U and M3U8 playlists.\r\n\u25b6\ufe0fAdd M3U and M3U8 links from online websites or local folders on your phone.\r\n\u25b6\ufe0fWatch multiple IPTV live sources by adding Xtream Code Api.\r\n\u25b6\ufe0fWatch live channels, EPG & check the current/next channel name, broadcast time & duration...\r\n\u25b6\ufe0fCast to Chromecast-enabled smart TVs with HD quality.\r\n\u25b6\ufe0fChange playback ratio, volume and brightness as you like.\r\n\u25b6\ufe0fEnter and search for your favorite channels with the phone keyboard fast and easily.\r\n\u25b6\ufe0fSave your favorite programs at any time on this super stream player.\r\n\u25b6\ufe0fFind shows you've watched to continue watching with just one click.\r\n\u25b6\ufe0fYou can enjoy high definition quality with fast buffering.\r\n\u25b6\ufe0fOur specially-designed user-friendly interface will make you master using the smart IPTV app in seconds.\r\n\u25b6\ufe0fEasy design and a few exquisite menu buttons make our IPTV stream player become easy to use. \r\n\r\nNote: \r\nSome links may be unavailable due to the expiration/invalidation or the server issue. In this case, you can try updating the link (Usually, we'll automatically update your channel list when you open your IPTV playlist for the first time every day.) or contact the provider to get the latest one or try again later.\r\n\r\nOur IPTV xtream player has multiple practical functions just like many other IPTV applications including IPTVTune, OTTOcean, KEMO IPTV,Xtreme HD IPTV, TrendyScreen... You will never regret choosing it. Download & try our powerful m3u/m3u8 player now!\r\n\r\nImportant Disclaimer:\r\n-The IPTV player app doesn't contain any built-in channels.\r\n-Users should have their own playlist with TV channels to use this m3u/m3u8 player app.\r\n-This IPTV player doesn't offer any kind of IPTV services like IPTV subscriptions or streams.\r\n-The IPTV xtream player doesn't provide any audiovisual content to the users.\r\n-Users must provide their content .\r\n-IPTV Player has no affiliation with any third-party provider.\r\n-We don't support the streaming of copyright-protected material without permission of the copyright holder.\r\n-We can't ensure every M3U/M3U8 playlists have EPG information, as it is provided by the network service provider.\r\n\r\nTerms of Use: https://www.boostvision.tv/terms-of-use\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://www.boostvision.tv/privacy-policy\r\n\r\nVisit Our Page: https://www.boostvision.tv",
    "descriptionHTML": "IPTV player is a convenient media player which enables users to easily watch videos, live TV streams, movies and series with its built-in powerful smarter player by adding online or local M3U &amp; M3U8 files or Xtream Code Api. You can install this smart IPTV stream player on the phone, tablet and Android TV to enjoy your ultimate IPTV xtream player experience!<br><br>IMPORTANT: This IPTV player app doesn&#39;t supply or include any media content. We have no affiliation with any content providers and can&#39;t be responsible for the content provided by third parties.<br><br>Main Features:<br>- Support adding unlimited M3U/M3U8 streaming playlists. <br>- Support adding Xtream Code Api.<br>- Support analyzing M3U/M3U8 formats with EPG information.<br>- Easily add M3U/M3U8 files from online websites &amp; the local folders of your device.<br>- Watch IPTV live streams with built-in powerful IPTV Player.<br>- Cast to smart TVs enabled with Chromcast and get rid of small screens&#39; limitations.<br>- Adjust playback ratio, volume and brightness per your habits and preferences.<br>- Screen locks to avoid its rotation when moving the phone.<br>- Fast search for channel and add it to Favorites with one tap.<br>- Quickly find the watched program from Recently Viewed.<br>- Automatically update your tivimate IPTV playlist.<br>- Watch live TV on the phone, tablet and Android TV.<br><br>How to add M3U/M3U8 files? <br>-Click the &quot;Add&quot; button on the smarter player playlist page.<br>-Select &quot;Add M3U link&quot; and enter your M3U link in the input box.<br>-Wait for the loading to complete to watch live TV for free.<br><br>Advantages:<br>\u25b6\ufe0fThe stream player app is compatible perfectly with phones, tablets and Android TV.<br>\u25b6\ufe0fOur IPTV player works well with M3U and M3U8 playlists.<br>\u25b6\ufe0fAdd M3U and M3U8 links from online websites or local folders on your phone.<br>\u25b6\ufe0fWatch multiple IPTV live sources by adding Xtream Code Api.<br>\u25b6\ufe0fWatch live channels, EPG &amp; check the current/next channel name, broadcast time &amp; duration...<br>\u25b6\ufe0fCast to Chromecast-enabled smart TVs with HD quality.<br>\u25b6\ufe0fChange playback ratio, volume and brightness as you like.<br>\u25b6\ufe0fEnter and search for your favorite channels with the phone keyboard fast and easily.<br>\u25b6\ufe0fSave your favorite programs at any time on this super stream player.<br>\u25b6\ufe0fFind shows you&#39;ve watched to continue watching with just one click.<br>\u25b6\ufe0fYou can enjoy high definition quality with fast buffering.<br>\u25b6\ufe0fOur specially-designed user-friendly interface will make you master using the smart IPTV app in seconds.<br>\u25b6\ufe0fEasy design and a few exquisite menu buttons make our IPTV stream player become easy to use. <br><br>Note: <br>Some links may be unavailable due to the expiration/invalidation or the server issue. In this case, you can try updating the link (Usually, we&#39;ll automatically update your channel list when you open your IPTV playlist for the first time every day.) or contact the provider to get the latest one or try again later.<br><br>Our IPTV xtream player has multiple practical functions just like many other IPTV applications including IPTVTune, OTTOcean, KEMO IPTV,Xtreme HD IPTV, TrendyScreen... You will never regret choosing it. Download &amp; try our powerful m3u/m3u8 player now!<br><br>Important Disclaimer:<br>-The IPTV player app doesn&#39;t contain any built-in channels.<br>-Users should have their own playlist with TV channels to use this m3u/m3u8 player app.<br>-This IPTV player doesn&#39;t offer any kind of IPTV services like IPTV subscriptions or streams.<br>-The IPTV xtream player doesn&#39;t provide any audiovisual content to the users.<br>-Users must provide their content .<br>-IPTV Player has no affiliation with any third-party provider.<br>-We don&#39;t support the streaming of copyright-protected material without permission of the copyright holder.<br>-We can&#39;t ensure every M3U/M3U8 playlists have EPG information, as it is provided by the network service provider.<br><br>Terms of Use: https://www.boostvision.tv/terms-of-use<br>Privacy Policy: https://www.boostvision.tv/privacy-policy<br><br>Visit Our Page: https://www.boostvision.tv",
